WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.229
FILL. Show a balloon becoming larger as air enters.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.931
WEIGH. Illustrate air having small but real mass.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.931
MOVE. Show a pinwheel rotating in moving air.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.952
BREATHE. Show fresh-air ventilation in a classroom.
